API Endpoints	Table of routes
CPU-Friendly	Tere laptop ke liye note
Roadmap	Checklist (interview me impress karega)
Author	Tera naam + GitHub link
🔥 Interview Tip
Jab interviewer GitHub repo kholega, sabse pehle README dikhega. Isliye:

✅ Badges professional lagte hain

✅ Architecture diagram turant impact daalta hai

✅ Roadmap dikhata hai ki tu serious hai

✅ API endpoints table dikhata hai ki tu structured sochta hai

⚠️ Chhoti Si Cheez
README me maine your_gemini_api_key_here placeholder daala hai — tu apna asli key kabhi README me mat likhna. Wo .env file me rahega (aur .env .gitignore me hona chahiye).

✅ Ab Aage Kya?
Bhai, README ready hai. Ab bata:

🔵 "A" → Backend code shuru karein (FastAPI + models + routes + AI) — file by file

🟢 "B" → Frontend code shuru karein (React + Tailwind + UI) — file by file

🟡 "C" → Database schema + SQLAlchemy models — file by file

🔴 "D" → Sab kuch ek saath, complete project (recommended) 🚀

Bol bhai, aur hum shuru karte hain! 💪

