## 🚀 Getting Started

### **Prerequisites**

- Python 3.11+
- Node.js 18+
- Git
- Google Gemini API key → [Get one free](https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey)

### **1️⃣ Clone the Repository**

```bash
git clone https://github.com/vishakha2121/PatentIQ-AI-Autonomous-Research-Patent-Discovery-Agent.git
cd PatentIQ-AI-Autonomous-Research-Patent-Discovery-Agent
2️⃣ Backend Setup
bash
cd backend

# Create virtual environment
python -m venv .venv

# Activate (Windows)
.venv\Scripts\activate

# Activate (Mac/Linux)
source .venv/bin/activate

# Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

# Create .env file
cp .env.example .env
# Edit .env and add your GEMINI_API_KEY

# Run backend
uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8000
Backend will be live at → http://localhost:8000
API docs → http://localhost:8000/docs

3️⃣ Frontend Setup
bash
cd frontend

# Install dependencies
npm install

# Create .env file
cp .env.example .env
# Set VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000

# Run frontend
npm run dev
Frontend will be live at → http://localhost:5173

⚙️ Environment Variables
backend/.env
env
# Gemini API
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-1.5-flash
GEMINI_EMBEDDING_MODEL=text-embedding-004

# Database
DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./data/patents.db

# Patent APIs
PATENTSVIEW_API_KEY=your_patentsview_key
EPO_OPS_KEY=your_epo_key
EPO_OPS_SECRET=your_epo_secret

# Server
BACKEND_HOST=0.0.0.0
BACKEND_PORT=8000

# FAISS
FAISS_INDEX_PATH=./data/faiss_index/index.faiss
FAISS_METADATA_PATH=./data/faiss_index/metadata.json

# CORS
CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173
frontend/.env
env
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000
VITE_APP_NAME=PatentIQ
🧪 API Endpoints
Method	Endpoint	Description
GET	/health	Health check
POST	/api/search	Semantic patent search
GET	/api/patents/{id}	Get patent details
POST	/api/compare	Compare two patents
POST	/api/novelty	Get novelty score
POST	/api/draft	Generate patent draft
GET	/api/gaps	List innovation gaps
GET	/api/graph	Knowledge graph data
GET	/api/citations/{id}	Citation network
Full API docs available at → /docs (Swagger UI)

🖥️ CPU-Only Friendly
This project is optimized for CPU-only environments — no GPU required.

Task	Tool	CPU Support
LLM	Gemini API (cloud)	✅
Embeddings	Gemini Embeddings	✅
Vector Search	FAISS-CPU	✅
Knowledge Graph	NetworkX	✅
Database	SQLite	✅
Backend	FastAPI + Uvicorn	✅
Frontend	React + Vite	✅
⚠️ No local LLM (Llama, Mistral) is used — Gemini API handles all LLM tasks.

